  <h2>6. Fees, invoicing and payment</h2>
  <p>Prices are in euros and exclusive of VAT. For Clients established in another EU member state with a valid VAT number, the reverse-charge mechanism applies.</p>
  <p>For fixed-price assignments, Sonaria invoices according to the payment schedule in the Proposal. If none is stated, Sonaria invoices 30% on acceptance and the remainder on delivery.</p>
