  <p><strong>AI automation.</strong> AI systems can produce incorrect or incomplete output. Sonaria designs automations with logging and the possibility of human intervention. The Client remains responsible for monitoring the output and for decisions taken on the basis of it.</p>
  <p><strong>Transactions and buy-and-build.</strong> In acquisition and buy-and-build projects Sonaria acts as adviser. Decisions to buy, sell, invest or finance are the Client's own. Sonaria does not provide regulated investment services. Where legal, tax or accounting advice is required under local law, the Client engages its own qualified advisers.</p>

